<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold text-primary">MES 系統整合開發平台</h1>
        <p class="lead text-secondary">專注於製造執行系統的數據管理與跨系統介面整合</p>
        <hr class="w-25 mx-auto" />
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-md-5">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0 transition-up">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                        <div class="bg-primary bg-opacity-10 p-3 rounded-3 me-3">
                            <i class="bi bi-table text-primary fs-3"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="card-title mb-0 fw-bold">主數據管理 (MDM)</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p class="card-text text-muted">具備完整的資料維護功能，支持批次處理與高效 CRUD 操作，是系統運行的基石。</p>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check2 text-success me-2"></i>MySQL 資料庫整合</li>
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check2 text-success me-2"></i>批次匯入/匯出邏輯</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="@Url.Action("MasterData", "Projects")" class="btn btn-primary w-100">查看作品庫</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-5">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0 transition-up">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                        <div class="bg-info bg-opacity-10 p-3 rounded-3 me-3">
                            <i class="bi bi-cloud-arrow-down text-info fs-3"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="card-title mb-0 fw-bold">API 介面模擬監控</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p class="card-text text-muted">模擬 Postman 的動態介面，演示非同步請求處理、JSON 資料綁定與後端驗證邏輯。</p>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check2 text-info me-2"></i>POST / GET 動態動詞測試</li>
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check2 text-info me-2"></i>即時錯誤捕捉與狀態燈</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="@Url.Action("ApiMonitor", "Projects")" class="btn btn-info text-white w-100">開啟測試終端</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .transition-up {
        transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

        .transition-up:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 1rem 3rem rgba(0,0,0,.1) !important;
        }

</style>